@startuml
|Higher Studies Coordinator|
start
:Search/select record; enter status, date, remarks;
|Web UI / API|
:Send request;
|Application Service|
:Check role, record, date and state edge;
if (Valid progression update?) then (yes)
  |Repository / Database|
  :Begin transaction;
  :Insert ProgressUpdate; change current status; audit; commit;
  :Commit;
  |Web UI / API|
  :Show success;
else (no)
  |Web UI / API|
  :Reject invalid update without changing state;
endif
stop
@enduml
